      *> Shared trim paragraph (PR-021 pilot): byte-identical to the inline
      *> copies it replaces (see check_copybooks inline_dupes ratchet).
      *> Requires the standard WS-TRIM-IN/OUT/LEN + WS-I declarations.
       TRIM-VALUE.
           MOVE WS-TRIM-IN TO WS-TRIM-OUT
           MOVE 0 TO WS-TRIM-LEN
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 100 BY -1
               UNTIL WS-I < 1 OR WS-TRIM-LEN > 0
               IF WS-TRIM-OUT(WS-I:1) NOT = SPACE
                   MOVE WS-I TO WS-TRIM-LEN
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM
           IF WS-TRIM-LEN = 0
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TRIM-LEN
           END-IF.
           EXIT PARAGRAPH.
